      "role": "user",
      "content": "I've been reading a lot about Robespierre lately. Do you think his support for the Reign of Terror was just a pragmatic necessity to save the Revolution from collapsing, or was it actually a fundamental moral failure on his part?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
